	/// Majors block subtitle naming the levels present (plan §3.2). Ties to "Bachelor's graduates, 2024". 2024's provisional status (D46 item 6) sits in the block title: with it here, "Bachelor's & associate graduates, 2024 (provisional)" is 305 px in a 240 px box (29 jobs).
	measure 'Majors subtitle' = SELECTEDVALUE ( job_profile[majors_levels_label] )
